an10.99:4.9 | S: Why is that? | T: Why is that?
an10.99:4.10 | S: Because their little incarnation finds no footing in the depths. | T: Because his small body doesn’t find a footing in the depth.
an10.99:4.11 | S: If someone should say this, | T: “In the same way, whoever would say,
